<p>Customer satisfaction surveys.</p>
<p>Review requests.</p>
<p>Loyalty rewards.</p>
<p>Annual garden inspections.</p>
<p>Referral incentive programme.</p>
<p>KPIs</p>
<p>Customer retention rate</p>
<p>Repeat business percentage</p>
<p>Customer referrals</p>
<p>Google review count</p>
<p>⸻</p>
<p>Quarterly Action Plan</p>
<p>Quarter 1</p>
<p>Improve online presence.</p>
<p>Launch Google Ads.</p>
<p>Optimise Google Business Profile.</p>
<p>Implement quotation follow-up system.</p>
<p>Introduce referral programme.</p>
<p>Success Measure</p>
