<p>⸻</p>
<p>Quarter 2</p>
<p>Target commercial clients.</p>
<p>Build partnerships with estate agents.</p>
<p>Launch upselling programme.</p>
<p>Increase recurring maintenance contracts.</p>
<p>Success Measure</p>
<p>Grow recurring revenue and commercial work.</p>
<p>⸻</p>
<p>Quarter 3</p>
<p>Expand marketing campaigns.</p>
<p>Increase customer retention initiatives.</p>
<p>Review service pricing.</p>
