<p>Double down on highest-performing marketing channels.</p>
<p>Plan next year’s growth strategy.</p>
<p>Prepare staffing and equipment for future expansion.</p>
<p>Success Measure</p>
<p>Achieve annual revenue target and prepare for the next growth phase.</p>
<p>⸻</p>
<p>Monthly CEO Revenue Review</p>
<p>Review the following every month:</p>
<p>Total Revenue</p>
<p>Gross Profit</p>
<p>Net Profit</p>
<p>New Leads</p>
<p>Quotes Sent</p>
<p>Quote Conversion %</p>
<p>Average Job Value</p>
<p>Commercial Revenue</p>
<p>Recurring Revenue</p>
<p>New Maintenance Contracts</p>
<p>Customer Retention</p>
<p>Referral Revenue</p>
<p>Marketing ROI</p>
<p>⸻</p>
<p>Key Performance Indicators (CEO Dashboard)</p>
<p>&lt;TABLE&gt;</p>
<p>KPI | Monthly Target | Actual</p>
<p>Revenue |  |</p>
<p>Gross Profit |  |</p>
<p>Net Profit |  |</p>
<p>New Leads |  |</p>
