n, loss, late arrival or incompleteness of or tampering or interference with any of the information contained in this email or for its incorrect delivery or non-delivery for whatsoever reason or for its effect on any electronic device of the recipient. If verification of this email or any attachment is required, please request a hard copy version. Nedbank Limited email Security Code E1922E468EF24D74EBC2C2244574CBF1C2FBF837 Nedbank Limited confirms that the following payment has been made: : : : : : : : : : ...539991 FIRST NATIONAL BANK landscapers Inc Recipient Reference : Nedbank will never send you an e-mail link to access Verify payments, always go to Online Banking on www.nedbank.co.za and click on Verify payments.', 'x2/Purchases/Proof_Of_Payment (2).pdf', '[]'::jsonb, 1, null, false, 'x2/Purchases/Proof_Of_Payment (2).pdf', true, 'FINANCE/Purchases/Proof_Of_Payment (2).pdf', 'drive-finance/file-0d10cd8ceb721419577d8c0e/Proof_Of_Payment (2).pdf', '{"sha256":"0d10cd8ceb721419577d8c0ef5a2d158681273a0c722258907f56d5caf0257d4","also_at":["x2/Purchases/Proof_Of_Payment (2).pdf"]}'::jsonb) on conflict (id) do update set name = excluded.name, drive_id = excluded.drive_id, folder_id = excluded.folder_id, mime = excluded.mime, size = excluded.size, kind = excluded.kind, description = excluded.description, tags = excluded.tags, text_index = excluded.text_index, source_path = excluded.source_path, linked = excluded.linked, version = excluded.version, expires_on = excluded.expires_on, confidential = excluded.confidential, _src = excluded._src, _seed = excluded._seed, vault_path = excluded.vault_path, storage_path = excluded.storage_path, data = excluded.data where public.files._seed and public.files.updated_by is not distinct from public.files.created_by;
