ny vehicles, equipment and tools responsibly.","required":false},{"id":"s7q1","type":"checkbox","label":"Report damaged or missing equipment immediately.","required":false},{"id":"s7q2","type":"checkbox","label":"Keep vehicles and equipment clean and well maintained.","required":false},{"id":"s7q3","type":"checkbox","label":"Do not use company assets for unauthorised personal purposes.","required":false},{"id":"s8","type":"section","label":"9. Communication","help":null},{"id":"s8q0","type":"checkbox","label":"Follow the company''s communication procedures.","required":false},{"id":"s8q1","type":"checkbox","label":"Report operational issues promptly.","required":false},{"id":"s8q2","type":"checkbox","label":"Keep managers informed of delays or risks.","required":false},{"id":"s8q3","type":"checkbox","label":"Maintain accurate operational records.","required":false},{"id":"s9","type":"section","label":"10. Confidentiality","help":null},{"id":"s9q0","type":"checkbox","label":"Protect company information.","required":false},{"id":"s9q1","type":"checkbox","label":"Do not disclose confidential business or client information without authorisation.","required":false},{"id":"s9q2","type":"checkbox","label":"Respect the privacy of colleagues and clients.","required":false},{"id":"s10","type":"section","label":"11. Accountability (every employee is responsible for)","help":null},{"id":"s10q0","type":"checkbox","label":"Completing assigned duties.","required":false},{"id":"s10q1","type":"checkbox","label":"Following company policies and SOPs.","required":false},{"id":"s10q2","type":"checkbox","label":"Maintaining high performance standards.","required":false},{"id":"s10q3","type":"checkbox","label":"Taking ownership of their work.","required":false},{"id":"s10q4","type":"checkbox","label":"Continuously improving operational efficiency.","required":false},{"id":"s11","type":"section","label":"12. Unacceptable Conduct (may result in disciplinary action)","help":null},{"id":"s11q