insert into public.jobs (id, title, client_id, client_name, service_type, status, notes, _src, _seed, data) values ('job-carron-glen-plan', 'Carron Glen Estate — landscape & garden maintenance project', 'cl-cge048-328f68', 'Carron Glen Estate', 'garden_maintenance', 'in_progress', 'Maintain and enhance the overall appearance, health, safety, and functionality of the landscaped areas within Carron Glen Estate; ensure communal gardens, lawns, pathways and landscaped features remain aesthetically pleasing and well-maintained throughout the year.

Scope (22 items): Lawn Maintenance: Mowing of all grassed areas. · Lawn Maintenance: Edging along pathways, curbs, and garden beds. · Lawn Maintenance: Removal of grass clippings. · Lawn Maintenance: Lawn health inspections. · Garden Maintenance: Weeding of garden beds. · Garden Maintenance: Pruning and shaping of shrubs and hedges. · Garden Maintenance: Removal of dead plant material. · Garden Maintenance: Seasonal planting where required. · Garden Maintenance: Mulching and soil improvement recommendations. · Tree Maintenance: Removal of low-hanging branches. · Tree Maintenance: Light trimming of trees. · Tree Maintenance: Monitoring tree health and reporting concerns. · Tree Maintenance: Removal of fallen branches and debris. · General Estate Upkeep: Blowing and cleaning of walkways and paved areas. · General Estate Upkeep: Collection and disposal of green waste. · General Estate Upkeep: Cleaning around entrance features and communal spaces. · General Estate Upkeep: Maintenance of flower beds and feature gardens. · Additional Services (As Required): Pressure cleaning of paved areas. · Additional Services (As Required): Plant replacement. · Additional Services (As Required): Irrigation inspections. · Additional Services (As Required): Storm damage clean-up. · Additional Services (As Required): Special landscape improvement projects.

Completed rehabilitation works: Perimeter clean-up of the estate; Palm tree trimming and maintenance; Clearing of overgrown areas throughout the estate; Lawn edging and definition of garden borders; Weed control and removal; Redesign and improvement of the entryway landscape layout (Using plants and elements available); General garden maintenance and clean-up; Removal and disposal of green waste; Restoration and enhancement of the overall appearance of the estate.

